  "reason": "Existing evidence shows pca_n2000 RNA encoder and resnet50 image encoder (config_039) have shown strong performance in prior experiments (config_030: 0.635 accuracy). This experiment tests whether combining pca_n2000 with resnet50 and transformer aggregation (more complex than avgpool in config_030) could further improve accuracy. While slightly more expensive (estimated ~6.61 GPU hours), it addresses uncertainty about image encoder choice and aggregation method, balancing exploration of high-performing components with the remaining budget."
